							2194.736,
							230.089,
							-781.087
						],
						"pointId": 2
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 705480201,
					"content": "Here's a Snow-Kissed Dawn. Hope you like it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480202
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 705480202,
					"content": "Mmm... It's delicious, cutie.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480203,
					"content": "Pleasantly tart, sweet but not cloying, smooth on the palate, with a refreshing aftertaste.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480204,
					"content": "If anything, though, I seem to be feeling a little more energetic than I'd like...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480205,
					"content": "Perhaps you've unwittingly unraveled Glenfidia's secret and concocted an even more effective pick-me-up?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480206,
						705480207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480206,
					"content": "Should I tinker with the ingredients?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480208
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 705480208,
					"content": "Don't worry, there's no rush! Hmm... Your eyes are aglow with curiosity, as though you have many more questions to ask...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480209,
					"content": "Let's chat for a while. Take your time... inspiration will come soon enough.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480210,
					"content": "Which books have you collected today?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480211
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 705480211,
					"content": "*sigh* Since you're asking, it's been a bit of an unusual day.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480212,
					"content": "There's a chef, fresh out of training in Fontaine, who's recently taken up a position at the Goth Grand Hotel. She borrowed our most valuable book, \"The Mondstadt Millennial Compendium of Desserts.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480213,
					"content": "Apparently, she plans to use dessert-making techniques to improve the taste of various savory dishes. Something about reducing their greasiness...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480214,
						705480215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480214,
					"content": "Sweet meat dishes...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480216
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 705480216,
					"content": "Indeed... and judging by the results, she rather overdid it with the caramel sauce. What should have been fragrant meat slices ended up tasting nauseatingly sweet.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480217,
					"content": "Caramel sauce is such a fantastic ingredient, you know? It never fails to please when added to drinks. Sometimes, I even add a spoonful to my afternoon tea.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480218,
					"content": "Improving food, I suppose, isn't always about being as creative as possible.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480219,
					"content": "By the way... Is that a notebook you brought with you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480220
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 705480220,
					"content": "Oh, this? That was for another of today's little errands.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480221,
					"content": "A large contingent of the expedition team will be returning to Mondstadt soon. They've been away for such a long time, so there's a good chance many of their tastes have changed.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480222,
					"content": "Jean asked me to visit some of their families to try and get a better understanding of what new ingredients might satisfy our knights' changing preferences.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480223,
						705480224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480223,
					"content": "Such detailed planning...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480225
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 705480225,
					"content": "Well, they've all devoted their blood, sweat, and time to protecting Mondstadt. They deserve some care and respect in return.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480226,
					"content": "Based on what I gathered, the most requested ingredient was Cacahuatl from Natlan. It seems like our knights have developed a taste for cocoa.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480227,
					"content": "In their letters, many of them mentioned that they rely on cocoa to keep themselves energized. I've tried hot cocoa myself, and I must say, I find it just as effective as coffee when it comes to staying alert.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480228,
					"content": "Been anywhere outside the city lately?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480229
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 705480229,
					"content": "Surely you're not suggesting I'd take this opportunity to sneak off on a little countryside wander? ...Hehe, you caught me!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480230
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480230,
					"content": "My investigations into Mondstadt's lesser-known drinks took me to Dawn Winery, where I had a little chat with the Head Housemaid, Adelinde.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480231,
					"content": "On my way back, I ran into Ematol, out on patrol. She'd encountered some monsters she didn't know how to deal with, and in her desperation, asked for my help.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480232
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480232,
					"content": "I accompanied her on a detour to Wolvendom to teach some raving hounds a lesson... It's been a while since I've had such an invigorating workout!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480233,
					"content": "So, what kind of ingredients have you been into lately?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480234
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 705480234,
					"content": "\"Lately\"? So careful with your wording, cutie...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480235
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480235,
					"content": "Is that because you think that I, too, might have changed since we last met... or simply because you can't remember?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480236,
						705480237
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480236,
					"content": "Well, you're so well-traveled and well-read...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480238
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 705480238,
					"content": "Not bad at all! A flawless answer.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480239
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480239,
					"content": "Back in my student days, I might have been drawn to every new and exciting ingredient I read about, constantly expanding my horizons and stepping out of my comfort zone. But now, I've grown accustomed to a life of comfort and routine.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480240
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480240,
					"content": "To paraphrase a certain Liyue legal expert, my life is fast approaching a state of \"living out one's golden years in peace and comfort.\" I'm no longer so easily moved by adventure and excitement.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480241
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480241,
					"content": "I'm sure you remember — a few years ago, when we were adventuring together, you found me that sweet-tasting alchemical ingredient...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480242
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480242,
					"content": "Well, my tastes haven't changed a bit since then.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480243
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480243,
					"content": "Alright, I think I know what fits the bill.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480244
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 705480244,
					"content": "Let me rustle you up a new, improved version!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480245
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 705480245,
					"content": "As expected, cutie, your brilliant mind has grown even sharper. Just a few gentle hints were all you needed to light that special spark of inspiration!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 705480237,
					"content": "Surely it's normal for your tastes to change from time to time...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480238
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 705480224,
					"content": "Such thoughtful arrangements...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480225
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 705480215,
					"content": "That sure is a novel approach.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705480216
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 705480207,
					"content": "How about I adjust the recipe and mix you a new one?",
